## Final Judgement
The evidence overwhelmingly demonstrates that the claim is a baseless conspiracy theory known as "Pizzagate." Multiple credible sources confirm that Comet Ping Pong does not have a basement, no law enforcement investigations found any evidence of child sex-trafficking, and neither Hillary nor Bill Clinton have ever been charged or formally accused of such crimes. The claim originated from false online rumors and has been thoroughly debunked by fact-checking organizations. There is no supporting evidence, and the available information explicitly refutes the allegation.

